This is mind-boggling. With involution in taxi and rideshare services and an increase in gas prices, it’s now cheaper to take an electric taxi than to drive your own gas-powered car in parts of China.

This shift has helped China cut gasoline consumption by 10%, even as road travel continues to grow.

